---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PartnerLogos from '../../components/PartnerLogos.astro';
import siteSettings from '../../../data/site-settings.json';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About the Project"
  description="Detailed information about CARBODIGIPARD — objectives, methodology, work packages, and project team."
  lang="en"
>
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/en">Home</a>
        <span class="breadcrumb__sep" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span aria-current="page">About</span>
      </nav>
      <h1>About the Project</h1>
      <p>CARBODIGIPARD — Carbon Digitalisation Project</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container about-layout">
      <article class="prose about-content">
        <h2>Project Background and Purpose</h2>
        <p>
          CARBODIGIPARD (Reducing Carbon Emissions by Mapping Carbon Footprint in IPARD Investments)
          supports the EU Green Deal alignment priority defined for the IPARD III period.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Contributing to the preparation of IPARD enterprises for CBAM requirements under the IPARD III Green Deal target</li>
          <li>Implementing actions aligned with the Climate Change Adaptation Strategy and Action Plan (2024-2030)</li>
          <li>Contributing to the national 2053 Net Zero commitment through project outputs</li>
          <li>Addressing the fact that an estimated 26% of global greenhouse gas emissions come from the food supply chain and 14.5% from livestock activities</li>
        </ul>
        <ul>
          <li>Capacity needs and lack of guidance in environmental sustainability practices among IPARD enterprises that play a key role in rural development</li>
          <li>Lack of awareness on carbon footprint and the need for knowledge- and skills-based transformation</li>
          <li>Need for practical and accessible learning solutions, digital tools, lasting impact, and dissemination</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Target Groups</h2>
        <h3>Target Group 1</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>IPARD beneficiary livestock and food enterprises:</strong>
            Increasing carbon footprint awareness in enterprises with high environmental impact and
            improving their knowledge and skills for sustainable production practices.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <h3>Target Group 2</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>IPARD Agency staff:</strong> Strengthening staff capacity in carbon footprint,
            sustainability, and environmental impact to improve the quality of guidance and advisory
            services provided to IPARD beneficiaries.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Roles of Partners</h2>
        <h3>Universities</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Determining enterprise carbon footprints</li>
          <li>Delivering awareness training on carbon reduction plans</li>
          <li>Developing sustainable carbon reduction strategies for a selected group of enterprises</li>
          <li>Providing content and implementation support for the e-learning platform</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          ARDSI, the Lithuanian Paying Agency, and the Serbian IPARD Agency will improve awareness,
          knowledge, and skills of IPARD implementing institution staff regarding carbon footprint
          calculations in the agriculture and food sector, as well as CBAM legislation that is likely to
          become mandatory in the future.
        </p>

        <h2>Main Outputs</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Carbon Map and e-Toolkit</li>
          <li>e-Learning Platform (training modules, videos, and other content)</li>
          <li>Guidance documents</li>
          <li>Pilot training reports</li>
          <li>Dissemination materials</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Dissemination and Sustainability</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Dissemination goals:</strong> Increasing visibility of project outputs and reaching broader stakeholders</li>
          <li><strong>Access to target audiences:</strong> IPARD enterprises, consultants, universities, ARDSI/IPARD agency staff, and the public</li>
          <li><strong>Post-project use:</strong> Continued active use of training materials after the project period</li>
          <li><strong>Institutional sustainability:</strong> Integration of outputs into existing structures of ARDSI and partner institutions</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Work Packages</h2>

        <h3>Work Package 1 - Project Management</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Establishing effective communication channels among partners (email groups, online meetings, shared platform, etc.)</li>
          <li>Holding regular online coordination meetings</li>
          <li>Tracking partner budgets and checking eligibility of expenditures</li>
          <li>Preparing project inception, interim, and final reports</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Work Package 2</h3>
        <p><strong>Defining Carbon Footprint Parameters and Creating AI-Supported Carbon Maps</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Holding the kick-off meeting in Turkey</li>
          <li>Conducting a workshop and study visit to define carbon footprint measurement parameters (Czechia)</li>
          <li>Producing AI-supported carbon footprint maps for IPARD enterprises based on agreed parameters and methodology, and selecting enterprises to be included in the training target group</li>
          <li>Evaluating Work Package 2, planning Work Package 3 activities, carrying out a field visit, and receiving expert presentations on carbon footprint practices (Lithuania)</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Work Package 3</h3>
        <p><strong>Pilot Trainings and Demonstration Activities Focused on Carbon Footprint Reduction (Including Content Development)</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Developing training material content for carbon footprint topics</li>
          <li>Organising carbon footprint reduction-focused trainings and workshops for the target group (Ankara)</li>
          <li>Delivering online trainings for staff on carbon footprint, sector-based carbon footprint calculation, and carbon market studies (100 staff: ARDSI + SIA)</li>
          <li>Evaluating Work Package 3, planning Work Package 4 activities, and conducting a field visit (Serbia)</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Work Package 4</h3>
        <p><strong>Documentation, Sustainability, and Dissemination of Project Results</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Preparing the project website, social media accounts, and the e-Toolkit</li>
          <li>Preparing the e-learning platform for public use and integrating it into the project website</li>
          <li>Preparing the project dissemination report, compiling good practice examples, and drafting policy recommendation reports within the scope of IPARD programmes</li>
          <li>Multiplier events (1 day each by 5 partners): ARDSI, BSEU, LPA, SIA, SBU</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Project Information</h2>
        <table class="info-table">
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <th>Programme</th>
              <td>{siteSettings.programEn}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th>Grant Agreement No.</th>
              <td>{siteSettings.grantAgreement}</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th>Project Duration</th>
              <td>January 2024 — December 2026 (36 months)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th>Coordinating Institution</th>
              <td>Agriculture and Rural Development Support Institution (ARDSI), Turkey</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th>Number of Partners</th>
              <td>5 organisations, 4 countries</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </article>

      <aside class="about-sidebar">
        <div class="sidebar-card">
          <h3 class="sidebar-card__title">Project Status</h3>
          <div class="project-status">
            <div class="status-item status-item--active">
              <span class="status-dot"></span>
              <span>Ongoing</span>
            </div>
            <div class="progress-bar">
              <div class="progress-bar__fill" style="width: 55%"></div>
            </div>
            <p class="status-desc">The project started in January 2024 and will continue until December 2026.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="sidebar-card">
          <h3 class="sidebar-card__title">Contact</h3>
          <p class="sidebar-contact__desc">For questions about the project:</p>
          <a href={`mailto:${siteSettings.contactEmail}`} class="sidebar-contact__email">
            {siteSettings.contactEmail}
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="sidebar-card sidebar-card--highlight">
          <p class="sidebar-funding">
            This project is funded by the European Union. The views and opinions expressed are solely those of the authors and do not necessarily reflect those of the European Union.
          </p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <PartnerLogos lang="en" />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 300px;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .info-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .info-table th,
  .info-table td {
    padding: 0.65rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: top;
  }

  .info-table th {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    font-weight: 600;
    width: 40%;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .sidebar-card {
    background: var(--color-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .sidebar-card--highlight {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-color: var(--color-border);
  }

  .sidebar-card__title {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .status-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-success);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .status-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-success);
  }

  .progress-bar {
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--color-surface-alt);
    border-radius: 3px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .progress-bar__fill {
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-primary), var(--color-accent));
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .status-desc {
    font-size: 0.83rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .sidebar-contact__desc {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .sidebar-contact__email {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    word-break: break-all;
  }

  .sidebar-funding {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
